      "value": "@{5b7fc7e7c38b7866cb1cc063|full_name}: Do you purely want the ability that the seated/standing toggle provides in offsetting the avatar height? It would be welcomed but the player would still be required to rotate their head to see which makes this mode less than ideal in the majority of play.",
