  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-10-18T02:23:03.901Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I hope you to support Lying Play mode in addition to Standing Play and Seated Play. Especially when we are in a world created primarily for appreciation, I think this mode will reduce physical fatigue.\nThen, I think this is also a useful mode for people who are injured and can't get out of bed, for example.",
